<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use LLMs solely for checking grammar and polishing writing. Importantly, LLMs did not contribute to the conception of the research problem or the development of the core methodology.</p>
</div>
</section>
